---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for DevToolkit.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: [add date when you publish]</em></p>

    <h2>Use of the site</h2>
    <p>DevToolkit provides free developer tools "as is," without warranty of any kind. You're free to use these tools for personal or commercial projects.</p>

    <h2>No guarantee of accuracy</h2>
    <p>While we aim for accuracy, calculators and reference tools on this site (pricing estimates, code generators, conversions) may contain errors or become outdated as external pricing/specs change. Always verify critical calculations independently before relying on them for production or financial decisions.</p>

    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>Don't use this site to attempt to disrupt service (e.g. automated scraping that degrades performance for other users), and don't use any generated output (e.g. security tools) for illegal purposes.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Reach out via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
